{"id": 44, "name": "Grock", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b6bfa6adbe8c282a0b83f3f3a5bd85c7.png", "cls": ["Tank", "Fighter"], "specialty": ["Crowd Control", "Initiator"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["90", "40", "80", "60"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Stone man awakened from sleep.", "skills": [{"name": "Bastion of Stone", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_902/100_bb06fa77cd649eff0cc061706e029182.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Grock gains a Shield equal to 14% of his Max HP and empowers the next Basic Attack to deal <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> equal to 4<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+2% Total Physical Defense)</span>% of the target's Max HP (capped at 300<span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+20*Hero Level)</span> against non-hero units). This effect has a 18-12s cooldown (decreases with level), which reduces by 200% when near terrain.\n\nGrock's skills cannot be interrupted, and he gains 30<span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+6*Hero Level)</span>% extra Physical Defense while the Shield is active."}, {"name": "Mighty Swing", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_902/100_b4b1b8b21935b3455b44981f2a01404d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Grock strikes forward with massive force, dealing 240<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. Enemies with obstacles behind them are knocked back into the obstacle, launched airborne, and take extra <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> equal to 4<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+2% Total Physical Defense)</span>% of their Max HP (capped at 300<span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+20*Hero Level)</span> against non-hero units). If there are no obstacles behind, enemies are only knocked back slightly."}, {"name": "Earthen Rampart", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_902/100_e19cfc03bbe289fccbfc89a1ef6668be.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 14", "desc": "After a brief delay, Grock summons a stone wall in the target area, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and knocking enemies towards him.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Cancel the wall early."}, {"name": "Tectonic Charge", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_902/100_5226d8dc97b10a6a1a2416b3957dfc7f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 55", "desc": "Grock charges forward and gains Control Immunity, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in his path. Upon hitting terrain, he immediately stops and triggers a massive explosion that knocks nearby enemies airborne for 1s and deals 650<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+300% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. If this skill doesn't hit terrain, 50% of its cooldown is refunded."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Rapid Boots - Encourage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c5f2489ac5899556052ac0e963eff1cc.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Radiant Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2235566ea07c98eeece80a2cb56c296f.png"}, {"name": "Antiqu